── Prompt advisor_meeting ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

▶ advisor_meeting with both arguments
  getPrompt({"name":"advisor_meeting","arguments":{"student_id":"2201010","semester":"2025-1"}})
  ✔ 2ms → 
    {
      "_meta": {
        "io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo": {
          "name": "academic",
          "title": "Academic Records",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        }
      },
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Prepare a one-page brief for an advisor meeting with student 2201010 about semester 2025-1.\nUse calculate_gpa, get_transcript, attendance_summary and at_risk_students. Include:\n1. Semester GPA and classification\n2. Courses with a D or F\n3. Attendance problems (exam bans)\n4. Conduct score\n5. Three questions the advisor should ask the student."
          }
        }
      ]
    }

▶ advisor_meeting missing semester → ProtocolError
  getPrompt({"name":"advisor_meeting","arguments":{"student_id":"2201010"}})
  ✖ 2ms → ProtocolError (code -32602): Invalid arguments for prompt advisor_meeting: semester: Invalid input: expected string, received undefined

